OL,3,GNEWSARhino siblings celebrate first
OL,4,Abirthday with cake
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo rhino calves have celebrated their
OL,7,Ffirst birthday with cakes made of
OL,8,Fpellets, carrots and salad leaves.
OL,10,FSiblings Markus and Mo were born at
OL,11,FCotswold Wildlife Park, near Burford,
OL,12,Flast year.
OL,14,FThe pair weighed about 70kg (11st) at
OL,15,Fbirth, and now weigh about 500kg (78st)
OL,16,Feach. Their arrival took the number of
OL,17,Frhinos at the park to nine, the most in
OL,18,Fits 56-year history.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
