OL,3,GNEWSARhino siblings celebrate first
OL,4,Abirthday with cake
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite rhinos were close to extinction
OL,7,Fin the early 1900s, with fewer than 50
OL,8,Fthought to remain in Africa. They are
OL,9,Fnow the most numerous of the five rhino
OL,10,Fspecies, but the park says conservation
OL,11,Fremains vital.
